# Agent workflow and context state. Deliberately NOT tracked: this is tooling for
# building the app, not part of the app, and it does not belong in a public
# repository. The files stay on disk and are used locally.
#
# Consequence to know about: git worktrees are built from tracked content, so a
# delegated agent will not see these. Copy them into a new worktree by hand --
# see .claude/AGENT_PROTOCOL.md.
.claude/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
DECISIONS.md
HANDOFF.md
SHARED_TASKS.md
context-packs/
impeccable-reference/
skills-lock.json
tools/agent-*
tools/qa-*
tools/tmp-*

# Local QA captures and scratch content
*-preview.png
*-screenshot.png
notes/

# Playwright E2E output
test-results/
playwright-report/
